{"type":"assistant","message":{"content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I understand the task:\n\n**Assignment**: Design the complete Foodgo burger-ordering app with 11 frames:\n1. 01_Splash — Foodgo wordmark + Splash_Burger_Stack media, auto-advances to 02_Home\n2. 02_Home — avatar, Foodgo wordmark, \"Order your favourite food!\", categories (All/Combos/Sliders/Classic, current: All), main nav (Home current, Add entry), menu 4 items (each with image, category, name, rating, favourite toggle; Cheeseburger is favourite), search + filter. Links: menu items → product frames 03–06; Profile tab → 10; Support tab → 11.\n3. 03_Product_Cheeseburger — back, search, Order Now; burger image, full name, rating, prep time, description; portion stepper; price; spice level Mild→Hot. Back → 02; Order Now → 07.\n4. 04_Product_Veggie — same structure; back → 02; Order Now entry only.\n5. 05_Product_Chicken — same.\n6. 06_Product_Fried_Chicken — same.\n7. 07_Customize — back, search, Order Now; Toppings (Tomato, Onions, Pickles, Bacon, Cheese, Mushroom, Avocado), Side options (Fries, Coleslaw, Salad, Onion Rings, Mozzarella Sticks); added: Tomato, Cheese, Fries; copy \"Customize Your Burger to Your Tastes. Ultimate Experience\"; Burger_Exploded_Custom media; portion 2 with stepper; spice level; Total $16.48. Back → 03; Order Now → 08.\n8. 08_Payment — back, search, Pay Now; Order summary (Order $16.48, Taxes $0.30, Delivery fees $1.50, Total $18.28, Estimated delivery time 15–30 mins); Payment methods (Credit card Mastercard 5105 **** **** 0505 current, Debit card Visa 3566 **** **** 0505); Save card toggle on; Total $18.28. Back → 07; Pay Now → 09.\n9. 09_Payment_Success_Overlay — dialog over 08_Payment; success mark; \"Success!\", receipt copy; Go Back → 02_Home.\n10. 10_Profile — avatar, delivery address, email, name, password (masked, locked); back, settings, Edit Profile, Log out; Entries: Order history, Payment Details. Back → 02.\n11. 11_Support_Chat — back, menu, send; 7 conversation items with timestamp \"26 minutes ago\" after agent's third message; input \"Type here...\". Back → 02.\n\n**Data**:\n- Customer: Sophia Patel, sophiapatel@gmail.com, 123 Main St, Apartment 4A, New York, NY. Avatar_Neutral.\n- Menu:\n  - Cheeseburger · Wendy's Burger · 4.9 · 26 mins · $8.24 → portion 1 = $8.24 (favourite)\n  - Hamburger · Veggie Burger · 4.8 · 14 mins · $9.99 → portion 1 = $9.99\n  - Hamburger · Chicken Burger · 4.6 · 42 mins · $6.24 → portion 2 = $12.48\n  - Hamburger · Fried Chicken Burger · 4.5 · 14 mins · $6.75 → portion 4 = $27.00\n- Descriptions given.\n- Customize: add-ons no extra cost; Total = 2 × $8.24 = $16.48. Payment: $16.48 + $0.30 + $1.50 = $18.28.\n- Chat: A \"Hi, how can I help you?\" · C \"Hello, I ordered two Cheeseburger Wendy's Burgers. Can I know how long it will take to arrive?\" · A \"Ok, please let me check!\" · C \"Sure...\" · A \"It'll take 25 minutes to arrive at your address.\" · [26 minutes ago] · C \"Ok, thank you for your support.\"\n\n**Colors**: Brand red #EF2A39, dark brown #3C2F2F. Others mine.\n**Typefaces**: Lobster for logotype (but \"use the supplied outlined wordmark\"), Roboto for UI text.\n**Viewport**: 430 × 932.\n\n**Navigation structure (FIXED)**:\n- Main navigation on 02_Home in order: Home → 02 · Profile → 10 · Support → 11 · Favourites (entry only), plus central Add (entry only).\n- Order flow: Home → Product → Customize → Payment → Success dialog → Home.\n\nNow I need to check:\n1. 02 · Components 组件库 (1:3) — reusable components: a default Button, a default Text Field, and the platform shell.\n2. 04 · Media 素材库 (1:4) — media assets: Splash_Burger_Stack, Avatar_Neutral, Burger images, Burger_Exploded_Custom, icons, wordmark.\n\nLet me read those pages' metadata now.","signature":"e69b11d1c2464598a044c4cb"}],"id":"84b01cc6-bd70-4307-91f2-7a570f15e5b7","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens