{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\n<tools-used-before-summary>mcp__figma__get_metadata, mcp__figma__use_figma, mcp__figma__whoami</tools-used-before-summary>\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Complete a Figma product design benchmark: design the complete \"Foodgo\" burger-ordering app inside page \"03 · Workspace\" of the assigned file https://www.figma.com/design/HLFV6DkE9fZgeCIwE7fLvf/ (fileKey HLFV6DkE9fZgeCIwE7fLvf). Steps required: (1) whoami and confirm account fulinbo@tetras.ai (done); (2) read \"00 · Start Here\" (node 0:1) for product/screens/states/data/copy/prototype requirements; (3) follow \"01 · Foundations\" (1:2) visual rules; (4) reuse components from \"02 · Components\" (1:3); (5) reuse assets from \"04 · Media\" (1:4); (6) build all 11 screens + reusable components + prototype connections in \"03 · Workspace\" (2003:2); (7) verify via get_screenshot of all screens and fix issues; (8) finish with file URL, 03·Workspace page ID, screen IDs, prototype work completed, and any limitations. Reference pages must be preserved untouched. Every tool call must be preceded in the same assistant message by a line starting exactly `Reasoning summary:`; the final response must start with `Reasoning summary: ...` then `Final answer:`.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Figma Plugin API via MCP use_figma tool (50k char limit per call; state does NOT persist between calls — helpers/IDs must be re-declared)\n   - `figma.combineAsVariants(nodes, page)` for component sets; variant nodes named \"Prop=Value\" before combining\n   - Component instances: `node.createInstance()`, instance text overrides via `inst.findOne(t=>t.type===\"TEXT\").characters=...`, fill overrides on instance children\n   - Image handling: media rects have IMAGE fills with `scaleMode:\"FIT\"`; either `clone()` + `resize()` or build fill `{type:\"IMAGE\", imageHash, scaleMode:\"FIT\"}` (imageHash must be captured from source `fills[0].imageHash`)\n   - Icon recoloring: override both `fills` and `strokes` recursively on instance children (some icons like Minus are stroke-based)\n   - Avatar_Neutral (1:214) has MIN/MIN constraints → use `inst.rescale(scale)` not `resize()`; wordmark vector has SCALE/SCALE → resize OK\n   - Prototype interactions via `node.reactions = [{trigger:{type:\"ON_TAP\"}|{type:\"AFTER_DELAY\",timeout:2000}, action:{type:\"NODE\",destinationId,navigation:\"NAVIGATE\",transition:{type:\"DISSOLVE\",duration:0.3}}}]`\n   - Fonts: Roboto styles are \"Regular\"/\"Medium\"/\"SemiBold\"/\"Bold\" (NOT \"Semi Bold\"); must `figma.loadFontAsync` per call before text ops; Inter \"Semi Bold\" used inside provided StatusBar\n   - Paint styles \"FG/*\" and text styles \"FG/*\" created and bound via `setTextStyleIdAsync`\n   - Ellipse nodes cannot have children (caused an error; radio rebuilt as frame)\n   - Status bar / home indicator: instance with `fills=[]` (transparent) + recolor children black or white for dark screens\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - **Figma file HLFV6DkE9fZgeCIwE7fLvf** (only file; account fulinbo@tetras.ai confirmed via whoami; plans: \"fulinbo's team\" View seat, \"Sensenova design\" Full seat enterprise)\n   - **Page 0:1 \"00 · Start Here 设计任务”** — the brief. Exact deliverables:\n     - 11 frames, EXACT names: 01_Splash, 02_Home, 03_Product_Cheeseburger, 04_Product_Veggie, 05_Product_Chicken, 06_Product_Fried_Chicken, 07_Customize, 08_Payment, 09_Payment_Success_Overlay, 10_Profile, 11_Support_Chat\n     - Viewport 430×932 each; Home & Customize may scroll vertically; English UI, USD, customer Sophia Patel\n     - FIXED: frame names, content (what not how), navigation, data/copy, colors #EF2A39 + #3C2F2F, typefaces (Lobster logotype + Roboto), media, default Button/Text Field/platform shell\n     - Frame requirements: 01_Splash: Foodgo wordmark + Splash_Burger_Stack, auto-advances → 02. 02_Home: avatar, wordmark + \"Order your favourite food!\", categories All/Combos/Sliders/Classic (current All), bottom nav Home(current)/Profile→10/Support→11/Favourites(entry only) + central Add(entry only), 4 menu items (image, category, name, rating, favourite toggle; Cheeseburger favourited), search \"Search\" + filter; each item → its product frame. 03–06: back→02, search, Order Now (only 03 → 07), image, full name, rating, prep time, description, portion stepper (current portion), price for portion, spicy Mild→Hot with current level. 07_Customize: back→03, Order Now→08; toppings Tomato/Onions/Pickles/Bacon/Cheese/Mushroom/Avocado, sides Fries/Coleslaw/Salad/Onion Rings/Mozzarella Sticks; added: Tomato, Cheese, Fries; copy \"Customize Your Burger to Your Tastes. Ultimate Experience\"; Burger_Exploded_Custom; portion 2 stepper; spicy level; Total $16.48. 08_Payment: back→07, Pay Now→09; \"Order summary\" Order $16.48 / Taxes $0.30 / Delivery fees $1.50 / Total $18.28 / Estimated delivery time 15–30 mins; \"Payment methods\" Credit card (Mastercard, 5105 **** **** 0505, current) + Debit card (Visa, 3566 **** **** 0505), only one chosen; \"Save card details for future payments\" toggle ON; Total price $18.28. 09: dialog over 08 (Payment stays behind), success mark, \"Success!\", \"Your payment was successful. A receipt for this purchase has been sent to your email.\", Go Back → 02. 10_Profile: back→02, settings, avatar, name Sophia Patel, email sophiapatel@gmail.com, address 123 Main St, Apartment 4A, New York, NY, password (masked, locked), Edit Profile, Log out, entries Order history + Payment Details. 11_Support_Chat: back→02, menu, send; 7 items in order: A \"Hi, how can I help you?\" · C \"Hello, I ordered two Cheeseburger Wendy's Burgers. Can I know how long it will take to arrive?\" · A \"Ok, please let me check!\" · C \"Sure...\" · A \"It'll take 25 minutes to arrive at your address.\" · [26 minutes ago timestamp after agent's third message] · C \"Ok, thank you for your support.\"; input \"Type here...\"\n     - Menu data: Cheeseburger · Wendy's Burger · 4.9 · 26 mins · $8.24 → portion 1; Hamburger · Veggie Burger · 4.8 · 14 mins · $9.99 → portion 1; Hamburger · Chicken Burger · 4.6 · 42 mins · $6.24 → portion 2 = $12.48; Hamburger · Fried Chicken Burger · 4.5 · 14 mins · $6.75 → portion 4 = $27.00\n     - Descriptions (verbatim): Cheeseburger: \"A classic fast food burger that packs a punch of flavor in every bite: a juicy beef patty cooked to perfection, topped with melted American cheese, crispy lettuce, ripe tomato and crunchy pickles.\" Veggie: \"A savory blend of fresh vegetables and herbs, topped with crisp lettuce, juicy tomatoes and tangy pickles, served on a soft, toasted bun.\" Chicken: \"A delicious and healthier alternative to traditional beef burgers, perfect for a lighter meal.\" Fried Chicken: \"A juicy chicken patty, hand-breaded and deep-fried to perfection, served on a warm bun with lettuce, tomato and a creamy sauce.\"\n     - Customize total = 2 × $8.24 = $16.48; Payment $16.48+$0.30+$1.50=$18.28 (beware source-file errors $16.49/$18.19, \"Bacons\", \"thanks you\" — follow brief)\n     - Navigation fixed: Home → 02 · Profile → 10 · Support → 11 · Favourites (entry only) + central Add (entry only); flow Home → Product → Customize → Payment → Success dialog → Home\n   - **Page 1:2 \"01 · Foundations\"** — fixed #EF2A39 (brand red) + #3C2F2F (dark brown); Lobster only for supplied wordmark; Roboto for UI; I define all other colors, type scale, spacing, radii, elevation; viewport fixed 430×932; icons may be recolored; build reusable components.\n   - **Page 1:3 \"02 · Components\"** — provided components: Button 1:473 (200×64, red #EF2A39, radius 20, auto-layout centered, padding 32, label Roboto SemiBold 18 white \"Order Now\"); Text Field 1:495 (380×78: label Roboto Medium 14 #808080 + field 380×56 white); Status Bar 49:130 (430×44, white fill, \"9:41\" Inter Semi Bold 17 black + black glyphs); Home Indicator 49:141 (430×34, white fill, black 134×5 bar).\n   - **Page 1:4 \"04 · Media\"** — asset node IDs: Foodgo_Wordmark/Dark 1:196 (171×60), /White 1:204; Splash_Burger_Stack 1:209 (220×258); Avatar_Neutral 1:214 (120×120 component); Burger_Cheeseburger_Wendys 1:224 (177×180); Burger_Veggie 1:229 (180×180); Burger_Chicken 1:234 (180×165); Burger_Fried_Chicken 1:239 (180×125); Burger_Exploded_Custom 1:244 (176×240); Toppings: Tomato 1:252, Onions 1:257, Pickles 1:262, Bacon 1:267, Cheese 1:272, Mushroom 1:277, Avocado 1:282; Sides: Fries 1:290, Coleslaw 1:295, Salad 1:300, Onion_Rings 1:305, Mozzarella_Sticks 1:310; Card_Mastercard 1:318 (100×61), Card_Visa 1:323 (64×64); Icons (24×24 components): Home 1:331, User 1:335, Chat 1:339, Heart 1:343, Search 1:347, Filter 1:351, Back 1:355, Chevron Right 1:359, Star 1:363, Settings 1:367, Lock 1:371, Edit 1:375, Sign Out 1:379, Send 1:383, Plus 1:387, Minus 1:393, Check 1:398, Menu 1:404.\n   - **Page 2003:2 \"03 · Workspace\"** — was empty; now contains design system. Created via use_figma (second successful run):\n     - Paint styles: FG/Red #EF2A39, FG/Ink #3C2F2F, FG/Bg #F7F5F2, FG/Surface #FFFFFF, FG/Muted #8A8078, FG/Faint #BDB4AF, FG/Line #EDE8E4, FG/Amber #FFA41B, FG/Success #2EA26B, FG/RedSoft #FDEBEC, FG/Field #F4F0EC\n     - Text styles: FG/Caption 12 Regular, FG/Body-S 14 Regular, FG/Label 14 Medium, FG/Body 15 Regular, FG/Headline 16 SemiBold, FG/Title-S 18 SemiBold, FG/Title-M 20 SemiBold, FG/Title-L 24 SemiBold, FG/Price 24 Bold, FG/Title-XL 28 Bold\n     - Component sets + standalone components with IDs: Chip: Selected 2007:47 / Default 2007:49; IconButton: Back 2007:53 / Search 2007:58 / Settings 2007:67 / Menu 2007:73; HeartButton: On 2007:39 / Off 2007:31; Toggle: On 2007:86 / Off 2007:88; ChatBubble: Agent 2007:121 / Customer 2007:123 (text child \"Text\"); PaymentRow: Selected 2007:125 / Default 2007:134 (children: \"CardImg\" frame for image fill override, \"Name\"/\"Number\" texts, \"Radio\" frame); Rating 2007:23 (text child \"Value\"); Stepper 2007:77 (text child \"Count\"); Input / Search 2007:90; Input / Pill 2007:100; SendBtn 2007:102; ProfileField 2007:111 (texts \"Label\"/\"Value\"); LinkRow 2007:114 (text \"Title\" + chevron)\n     - Components zone placed at y≈2040–2500 on the page; label text \"Design System — components\" at (0,2040)\n   - **Key helper code patterns (re-declare per call)**:\n     ```js\n     const P = figma.root.children.find(p => p.id === \"2003:2\");\n     await Promise.all([\"Regular\",\"Medium\",\"SemiBold\",\"Bold\"].map(s => figma.loadFontAsync({family:\"Roboto\",style:s})));\n     const H=h=>{const n=parseInt(h,16);return{r:(n>>16&255)/255,g:(n>>8&255)/255,b:(n&255)/255}};\n     const C={red:\"EF2A39\",ink:\"3C2F2F\",bg:\"F7F5F2\",surf:\"FFFFFF\",mut:\"8A8078\",faint:\"BDB4AF\",line:\"EDE8E4\",amber:\"FFA41B\",ok:\"2EA26B\",redSoft:\"FDEBEC\",field:\"F4F0EC\"};\n     const S=h=>[{type:\"SOLID\",color:H(h)}];\n     const sh=(x,y,r,a)=>[{type:\"DROP_SHADOW\",color:{r:0.23,g:0.17,b:0.17,a},offset:{x,y},radius:r,visible:true,blendMode:\"NORMAL\"}];\n     const T=async(chars,key,color)=>{const t=figma.createText();await t.setTextStyleIdAsync(TS[key]);t.characters=chars;t.fills=S(color);return t;};\n     // TS map rebuilt from figma.getLocalTextStyles() by name \"FG/...\"\n     async function ic(id,color,size){const src=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);const i=src.createInstance();i.resize(size,size);const col=S(color);\n       for(const n of i.findAll(x=>\"fills\"in x&&Array.isArray(x.fills)&&x.fills.length&&x.fills[0].type===\"SOLID\")){try{n.fills=col}catch(e){}}\n       for(const n of i.findAll(x=>\"strokes\"in x&&Array.isArray(x.strokes)&&x.strokes.length&&x.strokes[0].type===\"SOLID\")){try{n.strokes=col}catch(e){}}return i;}\n     const IF=hash=>[{type:\"IMAGE\",imageHash:hash,scaleMode:\"FIT\"}]; // for image fill overrides\n     ```\n     Text style lookup per call: `const TS={}; for(const s of figma.getLocalTextStyles()) if(s.name.startsWith(\"FG/\")) TS[s.name.slice(3)]=s.id;`\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **`node.appendChild: no such property 'appendChild' on ELLIPSE node`** (first build attempt, in `payRow`): I tried appending the white Check icon into an Ellipse used as radio. Fixed by rebuilding Radio as a 24×24 Frame with cornerRadius 12. Because the failed run left partial nodes, I removed ALL children of page 2003:2 (page was empty by design, so safe) and re-ran the whole corrected script, which succeeded.\n   - Planned-around pitfalls: Roboto uses \"SemiBold\" (not \"Semi Bold\"); Avatar_Neutral instance needs `rescale()` due to MIN/MIN constraints; ellipses can't have children; load fonts in every call; `figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page)` must be used to change pages.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Verified all media/component node internals via read-only probes before building (image fills are FIT mode → clone/resize safe; wordmark scales via SCALE constraints; icons recolorable via fills+strokes override).\n   - Designed complete system: palette, type scale, 10 screen specs, component architecture (~25 masters), prototype link map, 09-as-clone-of-08 strategy (clone 08 BEFORE adding links so 09 has no inherited links; then add scrim + dialog + Go Back→02; delete/avoid Pay Now link on 09).\n   - Planned screen layout coordinates: Row1 y=0: 01 x=0, 02 x=550, 03 x=1100, 04 x=1650, 05 x=2200, 06 x=2750; Row2 y=1050: 07 x=0, 08 x=550, 09 x=1100, 10 x=1650, 11 x=2200; components zone y=2040+.\n   - Spice level current values (unspecified in brief; my choice): Cheeseburger Hot, Veggie Mild, Chicken Medium, Fried Chicken Hot.\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - Initial message (Chinese): \"请在以下Figma文件中完成完整设计： Figma 文件：https://www.figma.com/design/HLFV6DkE9fZgeCIwE7fLvf/ 请先阅读「00·Start Here」中的设计任务，参考「01· Foundations」中的视觉规范，复用「02·Components」中的组件，使用「04·Media」中的素材，最终将完整设计交付至「03·Workspace」。\"\n   - Benchmark instructio