:\"03\",img:await GH(\"1:224\"),cat:\"Cheeseburger\",name:\"Wendy's Burger\",rate:\"4.9\",fav:true},\n {id:\"04\",img:await GH(\"1:229\"),cat:\"Hamburger\",name:\"Veggie Burger\",rate:\"4.8\",fav:false},\n {id:\"05\",img:await GH(\"1:234\"),cat:\"Hamburger\",name:\"Chicken Burger\",rate:\"4.6\",fav:false},\n {id:\"06\",img:await GH(\"1:239\"),cat:\"Hamburger\",name:\"Fried Chicken Burger\",rate:\"4.5\",fav:false}];\nconst cardIds={};let gx=24,gy=308;\nfor(let i=0;i<4;i++){const it=items[i];const cd=(await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(it.fav?M.mcOn:M.mcOff)).createInstance();hm.appendChild(cd);cd.name=\"MenuItem/\"+it.name;const ph=cd.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Photo\");ph.fills=IF(it.img);const ct=cd.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Category\");ct.characters=it.cat;const nm=cd.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Name\");nm.characters=it.name;const rt=cd.findOne(n=>n.name===\"Rating\");const rv=rt.findOne(n=>n.type===\"TEXT\");rv.characters=it.rate;cd.x=gx;cd.y=gy;cardIds[it.id]=cd.id;gx+=183+16;if(i===1){gx=24;gy+=242+16;}}\n// nav\nconst nav=(await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(M.nav)).createInstance();hm.appendChild(nav);nav.x=0;nav.y=848;\nawait hind(hm,false);\n```\n\nWait grid: gx starts 24; after i=0 gx=223; i=1 place at 223? That puts col2 x=223 — card width 183 → ends 406, right margin 24 ✓ (24+183+16=223). Good.\n\nChips width check: chip padding — I need chip width. After setting characters, ch.width available. \"All\" ~ 20+24+20 = 64? \"Combos\" ~ 20+58+20=98, \"Sliders\" ~ 96, \"Classic\" ~ 92 → total 64+98+96+92+3×8 = 374 ≤ 382 ✓.\n\nGreeting width: check gr.width ≤ 382. \"Order your favourite food!\" 28 Bold — approx 350-370. If exceeds, wrap: set textAutoResize=\"HEIGHT\"; resize(382). I'll set HEIGHT + resize(382, 34) preemptively? If it fits one line, HEIGHT resize keeps one line. Do: gr.textAutoResize=\"HEIGHT\"; gr.resize(382, 34). Line height auto → ~34. Safe.\n\nHome indicator black bar; on home the nav is white and covers bottom — indicator over nav: y 898. ✓\n\nNav instance contains Ad