bel Caption mut, value Headline? Not sure — from B1: ProfileField (texts \"Label\"/\"Value\"). Value probably Body ink or Headline. I'll override with value text.\n  \n  Dividers between rows: rect 342×1 line.\n- entries y ~ 560: \"Order history\" LinkRow, \"Payment Details\" LinkRow — LinkRow master: white? From B1: LinkRow (text \"Title\" + chevron). Override Title text.\n- Buttons: Edit Profile (Button instance label \"Edit Profile\") width 382? Button 200 wide — resize(382,64)? AL inside: padding 32; resize width 382 OK text centered. y 640. Log out: custom 382×64 radius 20 redSoft bg + signout icon red 20 + \"Log out\" 16 SemiBold red. y 716.\n- back → 02.\n\nLayout: header 44-108; avatar y 124-220; name y 230; email y 262; card y 296: content: address field (~ label 16 + value 2 lines 44 = 60) + divider + email (16+20=36) + divider + password (36+?) → padding 40 + 60+14+1+14+36+14+1+14+44 ≈ 238 → card 296-534. entries y 554: 2 LinkRows (56 each?) gap 12 → 554-676. buttons y 696: Edit 64, gap 12, logout 64 → ends 836 ✗ > 814! Tighten: avatar 88 (rescale 0.733) y 120-208; name 218; email 250; card y 284 → 522; entries 542-652; buttons y 672: edit 64 → 736; logout 748-812 ✓ barely. Hmm logout ends 812 < 814 ✓.\n\nLet me compute more carefully with LinkRow height unknown. I'll query instance height after creation and position dynamically: y accumulates. Then check final y ≤ 814 in code; if overflow, compress gaps. I'll do dynamic accumulation with a cursor variable and fixed budget. To be safe: avatar 88; gaps small.\n\nLinkRow: I think it's 382×56 (with title + chevron, padding 16, white bg radius 16?). Fine.\n\nChat (11): x2200 y1050:\n- status; header Type=Menu with title \"Support\": hbMenu instance → findOne name \"Title\" set characters \"Support\".\n- messages container x24 y 128 w 382 AL V gap 12:\n  bubbles: agent = bubA instance (left, MAX? agent LEFT = default MIN), customer = bubC instance layoutAlign=\"MAX\"? In AL V container, set child.layoutAlign=\"MAX\"? Hmm layoutAlign values: \"MIN\"|\"CENTER\"|\"MAX\"|\"STRETCH\"|\"INHERIT\". Actually for auto-layout children, layoutAlign controls cross-axis alignment. \"MAX\" = right align. ✓\n  bubble text override: bubA has text child \"Text\". For long customer message: set text characters then textAutoResize=\"HEIGHT\" and resize(230) → bubble grows.\n  Timestamp: text \"26 minutes ago\" Caption mut centered: layoutAlign=\"CENTER\".\n- Order: A1 \"Hi, how can I help you?\"; C1 \"Hello, I ordered two Cheeseburger Wendy's Burgers. Can I know how long it will take to arrive?\"; A2 \"Ok, please let me check!\"; C2 \"Sure...\"; A3 \"It'll take 25 minutes to arrive at your address.\"; timestamp; C3 \"Ok, thank you for your support.\"\n- input bar y 828? Use consistent 814: bar h 118? Chat input bar: white, top radius 28, y 814 h 118: row: Input/Pill 322 wide + send 48. Pill default 322×48? From B1: Input/Pill 2007:100 — I think 322×48? Summary: \"Input / Pill 2007:100\" no dims. I'll resize to (322,48). Send btn sendBtn 2007:102 (48×48?). Place row y 830: x24: pill 322 + gap 12 + send 48 = 382 ✓.\n  Placeholder \"Type here...\" — override pill's text child.\n- back → 02.\n\nChat bubble heights: A1 short 46; C1 3 lines ~ 90; A2 46; C2 46; A3 2 lines 68; ts 16; C3 46; gaps 12×6=72 → total ≈ 430 → 128+430=558 ✓.\n\nSend icon inside sendBtn already white? SendBtn master from B1 — red circle + send white icon presumably. Good.\n\n09 clone: clone() then set x/y/name. Scrim covers whole frame incl. status bar — fine (dialog overlay aesthetic). Add scrim + dialog at top (append last = on top). Also in 09, remove PrimaryBtn? Keep (hidden under scrim). Fine — no links on it ever.\n\nGo Back button in dialog: instance of 1:473 label \"Go Back\" resize(272,64). In AL V parent with counterAxisSizingMode FIXED (dialog width 320, padding 24 → content 272): button child layoutSizingHorizontal=\"FILL\"? For instance child in AL V: set layoutSizingHorizontal=\"FILL\" works. I'll try; fallback resize(272,64).\n\nSuccess check: circle 88 green + white check icon 40 centered: frame NONE 88×88, ellipse 88, check instance at (24,24).\n\nDialog: frame 320 × auto: layoutMode VERTICAL, primaryAxisSizingMode AUTO, counter FIXED, counterAxisAlignItems CENTER, padding 24, gap 16, cornerRadius 28, white, shadow big. Position: x=(430-320)/2=55, y = center: (932-est 340)/2 ≈ 296. Set after height known: y=(932-d.height)/2.\n\nText center: body text textAlignHorizontal=\"CENTER\", width 272 HEIGHT resize.\n\n\"Success!\" Title/L ink.\n\nBody: \"Your payment was successful. A receipt for this purchase has been sent to your email.\" mut.\n\nProfile details — write now. Also profile entries: LinkRow titles \"Order history\", \"Payment Details\".\n\nProfileField value override with wrap: value node name \"Value\": set textAutoResize=\"HEIGHT\"; resize(300,20); characters=...\n\nPassword row manual: AL V gap 6: label \"Password\" Caption mut; row AL H gap 8 center: dots \"••••••••\" Headline ink? make faint; lock icon 16 faint.\n\nActually to keep card uniform use ProfileField for password too, then append lock icon into the value row? Complexity — manual row is fine.\n\nCard rows: address (ProfileField), divider, email (ProfileField), divider, password (manual).\n\nEmail value: \"sophiapatel@gmail.com\".\n\nWrite Call F now. It's big — split: F1 = 09 + Profile; F2 = Chat. Do F1 first.","signature":"0aa51e95a7214dbd969c8fdb"}],"id":"2fe45847-241b-4243-baad-d0ff25ea3e59","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"99adcf7d-6023-4cb2-98f0-822f073f5505","uuid":"48c42150-f6d8-4283-b9f9-7804cab3e5b6","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:49:36.910Z","thinking_duration_ms":43586}
