30-886 < 898 ✓.\n  Pill placeholder already \"Type here...\" ✓ (text child name \"Type here...\").\n- back → 02.\n\nMessage data with types:\nA \"Hi, how can I help you?\"\nC \"Hello, I ordered two Cheeseburger Wendy's Burgers. Can I know how long it will take to arrive?\"\nA \"Ok, please let me check!\"\nC \"Sure...\"\nA \"It'll take 25 minutes to arrive at your address.\"\nTS \"26 minutes ago\"\nC \"Ok, thank you for your support.\"\n\nBubble text: bubA/bubC masters have text child named \"Text\". For A1 etc: override. Widths: short texts hug; long ones wrap at 240.\n\nNote: bubble master text WIDTH_AND_HEIGHT default. For long: t.textAutoResize=\"HEIGHT\"; t.resize(240,18).\n\nTimestamp text \"26 minutes ago\" Caption mut centered: create T() then layoutAlign=\"CENTER\".\n\nTotal heights ≈ 46+84+46+46+64+16+46+6×12 = 408 → ends ~ 536 ✓.","signature":"a35059242bd446929e1b20a8"}],"id":"250a1779-fa1e-4c0b-91b5-630e49aa2561","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"99adcf7d-6023-4cb2-98f0-822f073f5505","uuid":"dc51167c-41c7-4efb-b74c-e6d876ff32aa","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:51:26.366Z","thinking_duration_ms":30625}
