r:{type:\"ON_TAP\"},action:{type:\"NODE\",destinationId:\"...\",navigation:\"NAVIGATE\",transition:{type:\"DISSOLVE\",duration:0.3}}}]. For splash: trigger {type:\"AFTER_DELAY\", timeout:2000}.\n\nNote: setting reactions on instance children (like tab inside nav instance) — allowed (overrides).\n\nAlso target 09 as destination: 09 is a top-level frame ✓. Note: In prototypes, navigating to 09 shows just frame 09 (which is full clone incl. its own bg) — good.\n\nOne nuance: 09's GoBack → 02 ✓.\n\nSplash ON_TAP too? Brief says auto-advances. Add AFTER_DELAY only.\n\nAlso add back-to-02 from 04/05/06 backs. Order Now buttons on 04-06: no navigation (brief: only 03 → 07).\n\nWrite proto call: find all needed nodes, set reactions. Return summary. Note: reactions on instance children require the parent frame not be inside component? They're frame instances on page — setting reaction override on instance child is fine.\n\nLet me write it.","signature":"a1aab3471bc34e43b1bb1ad6"}],"id":"fa3afa29-d164-4e52-ae3b-0632baed8e1f","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"99adcf7d-6023-4cb2-98f0-822f073f5505","uuid":"370df214-55ed-40e3-9be0-81b023d2d1af","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:53:12.281Z","thinking_duration_ms":15448}
