dth 60 → wraps \"Mozzarella\" / \"Sticks\" 2 lines. Currently it wrapped as \"Mozzare lla Stic ks\" which suggests the text box is narrower than the word. Set the label width wider (68) and fontSize 11 → \"Mozzarella\" fits 10 chars at 11px in 60px? ~5.5px/char * 10 = 55px OK.\n\nAlso \"Onion Ring\" wraps to 2 lines \"Onion Ring\" — that's fine (2 lines OK). \"Mozzare lla Stic ks\" is 4 lines and overflows the tile (tile height 96; image + 4 lines ~ 76+). It shows text overflowing below the tile boundary. Fix that one.\n\n3. **08 Payment**: looks great. No issues.\n\n4. **05**: fine (2-line desc, no overlap).\n\n5. **06**: same Spicy overlap.\n\nNow screenshot 09, 10, 11.","signature":"9ef0fbb8ef124d63b2e1994d"}],"id":"f0255d4d-9706-49be-a074-4a5812e9529e","model":"glm-5.3-flash","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"99adcf7d-6023-4cb2-98f0-822f073f5505","uuid":"6b79cd4f-ec6f-4899-a393-cc5cfab5ecff","timestamp":"2026-10-28T19:59:29.371Z","thinking_duration_ms":17180}
