rrive at your address.\" — agent bubble, 3 lines. Also squeezed. Which ones did I resize? From summary: \"long texts HEIGHT+resize(238) — verify visually\". So bubbles 2 and 5 got the resize(238) treatment which failed → wrapped at ~90px? But then why 90 not 238? Because resize didn't stick at all and the text node kept its original width from when characters were set? The original width would be the text's natural width at... hmm, when I set characters the text auto-sizes to content width, which for long text might exceed 238 → I tried to clamp to 238. The clamp failed → text stayed at natural full width? No — screenshot shows narrow wrap (~90px). So the text node has fixed width ~90 with HEIGHT auto-resize. Odd. Maybe component text is 90 wide fixed? Whatever — detach & fix both.\n\nAlso check: customer bubble max width — agent bubbles in screenshot: bubble 2 (customer) ~90 wide. Detach, set text width 238, HEIGHT, and reposition.\n\n4. **Chat bubble 2 height**: after fix, reposition bubbles below? The messages container is an auto-layout (AL V gap 12 at 24,128), so heights re-flow automatically. Good.\n\n5. **02 Home**: looks good. Heart on card 1 red, others outline. \n\n6. **09 overlay**: good. 10 profile: good. 01 splash: good.\n\n7. **08 payment**: \"Estimated delivery time 15–30 mins\" — brief says \"15–30 mins\" ✓. Card numbers ✓.\n\nNow also product pages 03-06: check spicy chips match brief: 03 Hot selected ✓ (brief: spicy Mild→Hot with current level; Cheeseburger current = Hot per source). 04 Mild selected ✓. 05 Medium ✓. 06 Hot ✓. Portion counts: 03:1 ✓, 04:1 ✓, 05:2 ✓, 06:4 ✓. Prices ✓ ($8.24, $9.99, $12.48, $27.00).\n\nOne more check on product pages: \"Order Now\" button on 04-06 present but no link (per brief, only 03 → 07). Fine.\n\nFix plan (single use_figma call):\nA. Product screens 03 (2012:313), 04 (2012:379), 06 (2012:511): find \"Spicy\" text label, spicy chips frame, \"Portion\" label, stepper instance — shift each down by 24px. How are the